# Check out every text file with LF on all platforms. gofmt rejects CRLF Go
# sources, bash rejects CRLF scripts, and the fixture corpus is compared
# byte for byte with a fresh generation.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The fixture corpus (archives, manifest.json, SHA256SUMS) is generated
# output: never convert it.
/fixtures/** -text
*.pmtiles binary
*.mbtiles binary
